('ielts-audit-028', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-fill-blanks', 'Fill in the blanks', 'Community garden', 'Listen and complete the notes. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer. This is a short practice drill with synthesised playback.', 180, 0, 2, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice','IELTS'], NULL, NULL, 'The recording gives these answers in order: morning, bakery. Do not include extra words.', 'Coordinator: The garden needs volunteers to water young plants. Watering takes place in the morning, before the heat increases. Use the entrance beside the bakery; the gate near the school is locked during repairs.', 'Watering time: ____ (1)
