('ielts-audit-029', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-fill-blanks', 'Fill in the blanks', 'Student project planning', 'Listen and complete the notes. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer. This is a short practice drill with synthesised playback.', 180, 0, 2, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice','IELTS'], NULL, NULL, 'The recording gives these answers in order: questionnaires, market. Do not include extra words.', 'Student: We first thought of interviewing shop owners. Tutor: That could work, but your question concerns customers. Student: Then we will use questionnaires to reach more customers. Tutor: Good. Test the questions at the market before collecting data elsewhere.', 'Chosen research method: ____ (1)
Pilot location: the ____ (2)', '[{"id": "1", "correctAnswer": "questionnaires"}, {"id": "2", "correctAnswer": "market"}]'::jsonb, '["questionnaires", "market"]'::jsonb, NULL),
('ielts-audit-030', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-fill-blanks', 'Fill in the blanks', 'Urban tree research', 'Listen and complete the notes. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer. This is a short practice drill with synthesised playback.', 180, 0, 2, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice','IELTS'], NULL, NULL, 'The recording gives these answers in order: noise, hedges. Do not include extra words.', 'Lecturer: Tree shade can lower surface temperatures, but our study measured noise. We compared streets with similar traffic. The greatest reduction occurred where trees were combined with hedges, rather than where trees stood alone.', 'Variable measured: ____ (1)
Trees were most effective with: ____ (2)', '[{"id": "1", "correctAnswer": "noise"}, {"id": "2", "correctAnswer": "hedges"}]'::jsonb, '["noise", "hedges"]'::jsonb, NULL),
('ielts-audit-031', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-mcq', 'Choose the correct answer', 'Museum visit', 'Why is the main gallery closed? Choose ONE letter, A, B or C. Synthesised practice audio.', 120, 0, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice','IELTS'], NULL, NULL, 'The speaker explicitly supports B: Its lighting is being replaced.', 'Guide: The main gallery is closed while its lighting is replaced. Some visitors thought the roof was damaged, but that work was finished last year. The new exhibition opens next month, after the lights have been tested.', NULL, NULL, '["B"]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Its roof is being repaired."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Its lighting is being replaced."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Its exhibition is being moved."}]'::jsonb),
('ielts-audit-032', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-mcq', 'Choose the correct answer', 'Choosing a research topic', 'Why did the student change the topic? Choose ONE letter, A, B or C. Synthesised practice audio.', 120, 0, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice','IELTS'], NULL, NULL, 'The speaker explicitly supports A: The original topic was too broad.', 'Student: I wanted to study national transport policy, but the tutor said the scope was too wide for six weeks. I have narrowed it to bus reliability in one district. Access to passengers is straightforward, and the library has all the background material.', NULL, NULL, '["A"]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "A", "text": "The original topic was too broad."}, {"id": "B", "text": "There were too few sources."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Passengers refused interviews."}]'::jsonb),
('ielts-audit-033', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-mcq', 'Choose the correct answer', 'A walking tour', 'What has changed about tomorrow’s tour? Choose ONE letter, A, B or C. Synthesised practice audio.', 120, 0, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice','IELTS'], NULL, NULL, 'The speaker explicitly supports C: The starting time.', 'Organiser: Tomorrow we will start outside the station as usual. Rain is unlikely, so the route stays the same. However, the guide has a later appointment, so we need everyone there at nine instead of half past nine.', NULL, NULL, '["C"]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "A", "text": "The meeting place."}, {"id": "B", "text": "The route."}, {"id": "C", "text": "The starting time."}]'::jsonb),
('ielts-audit-034', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-mcq', 'Choose the correct answer', 'Booking a study room', 'What must a student do to keep a room reservation? Choose ONE letter, A, B or C. Synthesised practice audio.', 120, 0, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice','IELTS'], NULL, NULL, 'The speaker explicitly supports B: Confirm by email.', 'Librarian: You can reserve a room online. You do not need to pay a deposit or show a student card at reception. But you must confirm the reservation using the email we send; otherwise it expires after an hour.', NULL, NULL, '["B"]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Pay a deposit."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Confirm by email."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Show a card at reception."}]'::jsonb),
('ielts-audit-035', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'listening', 'ielts-listening-mcq', 'Choose the correct answer', 'Testing packaging', 'Why was the plant-based package selected? Choose ONE letter, A, B or C. Synthesised practice audio.', 120, 0, 1, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice','IELTS'], NULL, NULL, 'The speaker explicitly supports C: It resisted damage better.', 'Researcher: Both materials kept the food fresh equally well. The paper package was cheaper, but it tore during delivery. We selected the stronger plant-based package even though it cost more, because fewer items would be damaged.', NULL, NULL, '["C"]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "A", "text": "It was cheaper."}, {"id": "B", "text": "It kept food fresh longer."}, {"id": "C", "text": "It resisted damage better."}]'::jsonb),
